  "pli-tv-bu-vb-np7:2.1.6": "<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Agāraṁ</i> is typically rendered as “in a house”. The problem with this is that it is not unallowable for a monastic to live in a building that is the equivalent of a house. What a monastic should not do is own a home and then live there. ",
