  "pli-tv-bu-vb-np7:2.3.2": "Sp 1.526: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Sesakaṁ āharissāmīti dve cīvarāni katvā sesaṁ puna āharissāmīti attho</i>, “<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Sesakaṁ āharissāmi</i>: the meaning is that he says, ‘After making two robes, I will return the remainder.’” ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-np7:2.3.3": "Presumably this refers to any leftover cloth after the robe(s) have been made. ",
